:: Seaside Stall Intro

:: Seaside Stall
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "seasidestall">><<effects>>
You are at the stall beside <<seasideshop>>.
<br><br>
<<if Time.openingHour()>>
    <<if !Weather.precipitation is "rain" or !Weather.isFreezing>>
        You see Karl <<karlaction>>. <<boxedducks>>
        <br><br>
        <<if $duckavailable is 1>>
            <<link [[`Ask about the new shipment`|`Seaside Stall Duck Pitch`+ _duckintros[_duckname].name]]>>
                <<set $duckcollection.>>
            <</link>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        <<if $duckcollected gte 1>>
            <<link [[Look at the boxes|Seaside Stall Duck]]>><</link>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
    <<else>>
        No one is manning the stall. <<boxedduck>>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>
<<else>>
    No one is manning the stall. <<boxedduck>>
    <br><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave|Remote Coast]]>><</link>>

